    },
    {
      "ribbon": {
        "icon": "snippet",
        "label": "Rise"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": [
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "audioSrc": "/assets/audio/extras/vocabulary/which-one/raise-rise/rise.mp3"
                },
                {
                  "boldText": "Rise "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "does not take an object"
                },
                {
                  "text": ", as it is an "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "intransitive verb"
                },
                {
                  "text": ". It is an irregular verb; its three forms are rise, rose, risen."
                }
              ],
              "lineBreak": true
            },
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Examples"
                }
              ],
              "lineBreak": true
            },
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "audioSrc": "/assets/audio/extras/vocabulary/which-one/raise-rise/the-sun-rose.mp3"
                },
                {
                  "boldText": "• "
                },
                {
                  "text": "The sun rose at 5.30 this morning. "
                },
                {
                  "ptText": "O sol nasceu às 5h30 desta manhã."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "audioSrc": "/assets/audio/extras/vocabulary/which-one/raise-rise/the-river-levels-rise.mp3"
                },
                {
                  "boldText": "• "
                },
                {
                  "text": "The river levels rise after heavy rainfall. "
                },
                {
                  "ptText": "O nível dos rios sobe após chuvas fortes."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "audioSrc": "/assets/audio/extras/vocabulary/which-one/raise-rise/rents-have-risen.mp3"
                },
                {
                  "boldText": "• "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Rents have risen sharply in this part of town. "
                },
                {
                  "ptText": "Os aluguéis aumentaram muito nesta parte da cidade."
